{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 15, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Arthur awoke to the familiar scent of pine and damp earth. Sunlight dappled through the leaves of towering trees, painting shifting patterns on the forest floor. He stretched, a groan escaping his lips, and blinked. The world felt… too vibrant. The colors were impossibly saturated, the textures unnaturally sharp. A robin landed on a branch directly above him, its breast a dazzling, almost cartoonish red. He reached out to touch a nearby fern, and it felt… responsive. He pulled his hand back, a creeping unease settling in his stomach. A small, wooden signpost stood nearby, bearing the words \"Silverwood Forest - Population: 12,478.\"  Arthur stared at it, heart pounding.  He glanced down at his hands, noticing they were a slightly rough, tanned texture, not his own. A strange, metallic glint caught his eye – a small, silver amulet hanging around his neck. He felt a sudden, overwhelming sense of detachment, as if he were observing himself from a distance, a character in a story he didn't understand.\n\n***\n\nPanic clawed at his throat. He tried to speak, but only a raspy, unfamiliar voice emerged.  He looked around, desperately searching for something, anything, that would explain this bizarre reality. A young woman with long, braided auburn hair and emerald eyes approached, clad in leather armor. She smiled, a perfectly symmetrical, almost unnervingly cheerful smile. \"Good morning, traveler!\" she chirped. \"Are you lost?  You look a bit… bewildered.\"  Arthur wanted to scream, to demand answers, but all that came out was a mumbled, \"Where… where am I?\" The woman tilted her head, her expression unchanging. \"You are in Silverwood Forest, of course! And you are… Arthur.  A new arrival, I presume?  The game is starting, you know.  Let's get you questing.\"  He felt a cold dread seep into his bones. This wasn't a dream. This was something far more terrifying. He was trapped, inside a video game, and he had absolutely no idea how to get out.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Arthur", "logprob": -0.7354406118392944}, {"token": "▁awoke", "logprob": -0.5083379745483398}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.003836772171780467}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.007919815368950367}, {"token": "▁familiar", "logprob": -1.6825653314590454}, {"token": "▁scent", "logprob": -0.694127082824707}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁pine", "logprob": -0.48880860209465027}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -0.3685031235218048}, {"token": "▁damp", "logprob": -0.0035027835983783007}, {"token": "▁earth", "logprob": -2.3483953555114567e-05}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -1.1396102905273438}, {"token": "▁Sunlight", "logprob": -0.10965830087661743}, {"token": "▁dapp", "logprob": -0.5858229398727417}, {"token": "led", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁through", "logprob": -6.794906312279636e-06}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.21949778497219086}, {"token": "▁leaves", "logprob": -0.020863592624664307}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.4369998872280121}, {"token": "▁towering", "logprob": -0.20865733921527863}, {"token": "▁trees", "logprob": -0.000722266617231071}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.02172062173485756}, {"token": "▁painting", "logprob": -0.7445850372314453}, {"token": "▁shifting", "logprob": -0.004982910584658384}, {"token": "▁patterns", "logprob": -0.0024096521083265543}, {"token": "▁on", "logprob": -1.597391747054644e-05}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.015930872410535812}, {"token": "▁forest", "logprob": -0.014663191512227058}, {"token": "▁floor", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -6.97350042173639e-05}, {"token": "▁He", "logprob": -0.06673534959554672}, {"token": "▁stretched", "logprob": -0.01342954020947218}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -2.0265558760002023e-06}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.2109721302986145}, {"token": "▁groan", "logprob": -0.9910007119178772}, {"token": "▁escaping", "logprob": -0.006321316584944725}, {"token":